<h2>Harness Composition and Effects</h2>
<p>Many elements are needed to build a harness, but the core ones are as follows. Some people call <strong>everything surrounding the model, excluding the LLM model itself</strong>, the harness.</p>

<h3>Core components</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Agent</strong> &mdash; an AI worker with a defined role.</li>
    <li><strong>Skills · tools</strong> &mdash; the capabilities and connecting tools an agent uses while working.</li>
    <li><strong>Orchestrator</strong> &mdash; the PM role that coordinates the agents so they work well.</li>
    <li><strong>Evaluation · tests</strong> &mdash; verify the output and keep the quality up.</li>
    <li><strong>Artifacts · memory</strong> &mdash; continuously manage the deliverables and the context.</li>
</ul>

